<title>SPAIN: Madrid bourse closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Madrid bourse closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid bourse was closed on Friday for a local holiday. Stock markets elsewhere in the country will operate as normal.</p>
<p>Trade on the Madrid bourse will resume as normal on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the general index shed 16.50 points, 2.69 percent, to 596.26, while the Ibex-35 index of leading shares fell 202.83 points, 2.91 percent, to 6,756.09.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
